      "desc": "Vain, pompous, debonair \"B-King\" who prioritizes dramatic swagger, romance, and looking cool above all else; wields a Jade-Bamboo Snow-Gold Fan that unleashes icy winds, which promptly freezes his nose and makes him sneeze uncontrollably (\"Shatter—Achoo!\"); has an atrocious sense of direction; loves Immortal Chess."
