      "desc": "Observant, jovial, shameless academic opportunist, yet deeply sincere in his passion for formation research. Inherited Mahayana cultivation via the Ran Clan's secret generational transmission technique, as array masters in this world are cursed with tragically short lifespans (mostly dying around Golden Core). Terrified by a Heavenly Book prophecy that the Ran Clan would be destroyed in his hands, he resolved to face death honorably while excavating ancient arrays in the Abyss Sea. Deeply grateful to Zhou Hui for educating his unruly daughter, he petitioned Zhou Hui to accept Ran Clan branch disciples as a backup seed."
